            <p class="mui--text-body1 mui--margin-bottom-medium">
              This platform allows users to upload their sheet music and recordings for sharing with select others.
            </p>

            <p class="mui--text-body1 mui--margin-bottom-medium">
              Annotation, editing, and customizable playback of the sheet music is all supported by the latest technology, helping users to teach and learn music in more effective and enjoyable ways.
            </p>

            <p class="mui--text-body1 mui--margin-bottom-medium">
              Use the triple-dot menu in the top-right corner to sign in or sign up.
            </p>

            <p class="mui--text-body1">
              If you were wondering, TSMLP stands for Teachers&rsquo; Sheet Music Library for Pedagogy.
            </p>

